# AGNIDRISHTI - Frontend Environment Configuration
# Note: CesiumJS operates completely without an Ion token by using open satellite imagery (Esri World Imagery) and ellipsoid terrain.
# If you have a Cesium Ion token and wish to enable Cesium World 3D Terrain, provide it below:
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=

# Backend API URL (Default: http://127.0.0.1:8000)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
